{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wdDFMsLhLX1795420695.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>元朗區二手交投平穩。美聯物業元朗 – 形點分行首席助理聯席董事陳鋒表示，該行最新促成尚悅一個356實呎兩房單位成交，獲區甫用家以390萬元承接。<br/>陳鋒表示，成交單位為尚悅7座低層D室，實用面積約356平方呎，屬兩房間隔。單位原本叫價410萬元，最終以390萬元成交，折合實用呎價約10,955元。<br/>資料顯示，原業主於2021年12月以約499.8萬元購入上述物業，持貨約5年，帳面蝕讓約109.8萬元，貶值約22%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.791540+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:38.269735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:38.269735+00:00","content_hash":"f3fb5b4c996f3f987887a819f25aa5f7ec547faa9e883141add96f29d8a73a70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}